{"resourceId": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/product.rz?theme_id=210260099402", "translations": [{"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.texto:1n33jn5cd44jq", "value": "Allumez une bougie, installez-vous confortablement et offrez-vous quinze minutes. Notre sérum transforme un geste aussi simple que votre shampooing en un petit rituel de soin.", "translatableContentDigest": "d544df1952fd2d309b4c3530ceabbf085bb3cece8d7f7e2e600275cada2eae45"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.ritual.texto:1n33jn5cd44jq", "value": "Acenda uma vela, fique confortável e ofereça a si mesma quinze minutos. O nosso sérum transforma algo tão simples como lavar o cabelo num pequeno ritual de cuidado.", "translatableContentDigest": "d544df1952fd2d309b4c3530ceabbf085bb3cece8d7f7e2e600275cada2eae45"}, {"locale": "fr", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f1.pregunta:3v70crvswyxrr", "value": "Comment utiliser le sérum ?", "translatableContentDigest": "05edb828f47c2acbe873fb365c481673c646bb7bde649abdedd7c5507f8524be"}, {"locale": "pt-PT", "key": "section.product.rz.json.faq.f1.pregunta:3v70crvswyxrr", "value": "Como se usa o sérum?", "translatableContentDigest": "05edb828f47c2acbe873fb365c481673c646bb7bde649abdedd7c5507f8524be"}]}